{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415810","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415810","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1041581001:1":{"text":"よぉ、そこのババリアの嬢ちゃん！それは腕当てか？グローブはどうした？","source_cn":"嘿，那位蛮血朋友！你手臂上的是护腕吗？你的拳套去哪了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3AA6030198403FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041581002:1":{"text":"グローブ？グローブなんて持ってないよ。","source_cn":"拳套？我没有拳套啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79440DE1A9941F2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041581003:1":{"text":"それに、これは腕当てじゃなくてウロコなんだけど……まあ似たようなものかな。","source_cn":"至于手臂上的……你说的是这两块鳞甲吧？说是护腕应该也没...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9736896462976BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041581004:1":{"text":"おっと！悪ぃ悪ぃ。てっきりお前さんもおれみたいに、拳で戦うレスラーだと思ったぜ！","source_cn":"噢！抱歉抱歉，我还以为你也和我一样，是个擅长用拳的摔角手呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46A677E29C6E86BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041581005:1":{"text":"えっ、僕、レスラーに見えるの！？","source_cn":"是吗？原来我看起来很像摔角手啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32F90A5CA1119D21","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041581006:1":{"text":"残念だけど、僕は体術が得意じゃないんだ。この頑丈なウロコがなかったら、ウール族を守るどころか、砂漠で生き残れたかも分かんないよ……","source_cn":"可惜我的武技其实不算很出众。要不是有这身还算坚硬的鳞甲...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x709823EDE6E1D790","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041581007:1":{"text":"だから、手合わせの相手を探してるんだったら、期待には応えられないかな。ごめんね。","source_cn":"如果你是在找摔角对手的话，可能要让你失望了，抱歉啦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0E79EFC37DCE043","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041581008:1":{"text":"ちっちっち、その言い方はいただけねえなあ。","source_cn":"不不不，不要这样说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6027097E86B7DA40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041581009:1":{"text":"若くて根性もあるうえに、体質にも恵まれてんだ！あんま自分を安く見るもんじゃねえぞ！","source_cn":"像你这么年轻又坚毅的孩子，还与生俱来这么出众的天赋，怎...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE2E78C05208E5F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041581010:1":{"text":"おれぁ砂漠に行ったことはねえが、あそこがどんだけ過酷な場所かくらいは聞いたことがある。お前さんは、十分自分の強さを証明してる！","source_cn":"我虽然没有去过沙漠，但也听说过生活在那种环境下有多艰苦...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9EFDBDF95240ACB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041581011:1":{"text":"瑠璃も玻璃も照らせば光る！お前さんはたまたま砂漠に生まれて、今は光が砂に埋もれちまってるだけだ！","source_cn":"“是金子总会发光”！你只是恰巧生在沙漠里，被漫天的沙子...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B866B8F7BC304EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041581012:1":{"text":"えっと……ありがとう。こんなふうに褒められたこと、あんまりないから。","source_cn":"咳咳……谢谢你的夸奖……很少有人这么夸奖我呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EBEF6D10958CEAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041581013:1":{"text":"でも、あなたの言う通り、砂漠の外の世界も見て回るべきだよね。あ、もちろん、一族のことをちゃんと整えたあとでね。","source_cn":"也许你说得对，我该离开沙漠外出旅行一趟——呃，不过要先...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8587802C22D35134","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041581014:1":{"text":"その時は、ヴェルディアの土地にも行ってみたいな！","source_cn":"到时候，我可以去绿裔的领地上看看！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB056A3D2D294065F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041581015:1":{"text":"ははっ、そいつはいい！その時はおれが出迎えてやるよ！","source_cn":"哈哈，那就一言为定！我会去迎接你的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6D061B91B481DDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status